survey attached. The statement and survey should be distributed to 20 to
30 potential customers (people who completed the concept statement test
should not be asked to complete this survey). Each participant should be
asked to read the statement and complete the survey. The format for the
survey is shown in Table 3.3.

To gauge customer interest, the number of people who indicate they defi-
