survey for a small fee.5

One caveat is that people who say that they intend to purchase a product
or service don’t always follow through; as a result, the numbers resulting from
this activity are almost always optimistic. The survey also doesn’t normally tap
a scientifically random sample. Still, the results give a potential entrepreneur a
general sense of the degree of customer interest in the product or service idea.
